    "verdict": {
      "candidate_15": "Strongly supported as the same exact AU top garment/item family. AU extraItemComment asset names use 1507320101, the Rakuten 15 manageNumber/newItemNumber/itemNumber and SKU manufacturer model for top-only S/black. The saved AU image sourced from its 1507320101 LP visibly states the cotton/polyester/polyurethane composition that matches the RA15 SKU attributes. AU size/color choices also align with the RA15 top-only family.",
      "candidate_16": "Strongly disfavored. Its exact 1718520101 S/black top-only model is polyester68/rayon23/polyurethane9 and has a separate lp_1718520101 image family. AU embeds the 1507320101 family; its saved product-information image says cotton67/polyester30/polyurethane3, matching RA15 and conflicting with RA16 exact-model composition. Sizes/colors overlap partially and do not by themselves exclude RA16.",
      "granularity": "This supports the item family; AU lists 16 size/color choices and the selected AU SKU is unknown. The 1507320101 LP stem and RA15 JAN provide S/black model evidence, but do not prove AU selected S/black. Wrapping does not distinguish the two candidates."
    },
